---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';

const title = 'Tong Zhu 朱通';
---

<Base title={title}>
  <section class="hero">
    <h1 class="hero-name">Tong Zhu</h1>
    <p class="hero-name-zh">朱通</p>
    <p class="hero-role">
      <span data-en="Professor of Physical Chemistry, " data-zh="物理化学教授，">
        Professor of Physical Chemistry,
      </span>
      <a href="https://www.ecnu.edu.cn/" target="_blank" rel="noopener">East China Normal University</a>
      <span> · </span>
      <a href="https://www.sii.shanghai.gov.cn/" target="_blank" rel="noopener" data-en="Shanghai Innovation Institute" data-zh="上海创智学院">Shanghai Innovation Institute</a>.
    </p>
  </section>

  <hr class="rule" />

  <section>
    <p class="eyebrow" data-en="About" data-zh="个人简介">About</p>
    <p data-en="Tong Zhu is a Professor at the Department of Chemistry, East China Normal University (ECNU). He received his Ph.D. in 2013 from the State Key Laboratory of Precision Spectroscopy at ECNU, after which he held postdoctoral and faculty positions at ECNU and a visiting scholarship at Academia Sinica in Taiwan. He is also an adjunct professor at New York University Shanghai and a doctoral advisor at the Shanghai Innovation Institute." data-zh="朱通，华东师范大学化学与分子工程学院教授。2013 年于华东师范大学精密光谱科学与技术国家重点实验室获博士学位，此后在华东师范大学历任博士后、副教授、教授，并曾赴台湾中研院访问研究。同时任上海纽约大学兼职教授、上海创智学院博士生导师。">
      Tong Zhu is a Professor at the Department of Chemistry, East China
      Normal University (ECNU). He received his Ph.D. in 2013 from the State
      Key Laboratory of Precision Spectroscopy at ECNU, after which he held
      postdoctoral and faculty positions at ECNU and a visiting scholarship at
      Academia Sinica in Taiwan. He is also an adjunct professor at New York
      University Shanghai and a doctoral advisor at the Shanghai Innovation
      Institute.
    </p>
    <p data-en="His research integrates theoretical chemistry with artificial intelligence, focusing on the precise elucidation of chemical reaction dynamics in complex systems. He has developed general neural network potential energy surfaces covering CHON elements, AI-augmented quantum chemistry algorithms, and the open-source ReacNetGenerator software for automated reaction network analysis. He serves as an editor for J. Chem. Inf. Model. and was a recipient of the NSFC Excellent Young Scientists Fund." data-zh="长期致力于理论化学与人工智能方法的深度融合，围绕复杂体系化学反应动力学的精准解析开展研究。构建了覆盖 CHON 元素的通用势能面，发展了 AI 增强的量子化学算法，并自主开发了用于反应网络自动分析的开源软件 ReacNetGenerator。担任《J. Chem. Inf. Model.》期刊编辑，曾获国家自然科学基金优秀青年科学基金资助。">
      His research integrates theoretical chemistry with artificial
      intelligence, focusing on the precise elucidation of chemical reaction
      dynamics in complex systems. He has developed general neural network
      potential energy surfaces covering CHON elements, AI-augmented quantum
      chemistry algorithms, and the open-source ReacNetGenerator software for
      automated reaction network analysis. He serves as an editor for
      <em>J. Chem. Inf. Model.</em> and was a recipient of the NSFC Excellent
      Young Scientists Fund.
    </p>
  </section>

  <section>
    <p class="eyebrow" data-en="Research Interests" data-zh="研究方向">Research Interests</p>
    <ul>
      <li data-en="AI–physics dual-driven simulation methods: neural network potentials, general CHON potentials, and specialized DFT / semi-empirical quantum chemistry algorithms." data-zh="AI–物理双驱动的模拟方法：神经网络势能面、CHON 通用势能面模型，以及面向化学反应的专用 DFT 与半经验量子化学算法。">
        AI–physics dual-driven simulation methods: neural network potentials,
        general CHON potentials, and specialized DFT / semi-empirical quantum
        chemistry algorithms.
      </li>
      <li data-en="Efficient reaction path search and network analysis: the rotation–translation invariant potential (RTIP) method, transition-state location, and the ReacNetGenerator software." data-zh="高效化学反应路径搜索与网络解析：旋转–平移不变势（RTIP）方法、过渡态快速定位，以及 ReacNetGenerator 软件。">
        Efficient reaction path search and network analysis: the
        rotation–translation invariant potential (RTIP) method,
        transition-state location, and the ReacNetGenerator software.
      </li>
      <li data-en="Applications: selective covalent inhibitor design, DNA reaction dynamics, and molecular pattern recognition." data-zh="方法应用：选择性共价抑制剂设计、DNA 反应动力学，以及分子模式识别。">
        Applications: selective covalent inhibitor design, DNA reaction
        dynamics, and molecular pattern recognition.
      </li>
    </ul>
  </section>
</Base>
